        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Bread is soft and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fluffy",
            "zh": "松软的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "holes",
            "ref": "v-hole"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in it. Do you know why bread has holes in it?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "To make "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "a loaf of",
            "ref": "v-a-loaf-of"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " bread, we should first use "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "flour",
            "zh": "面粉"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and water to make "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "dough",
            "zh": "面团"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". When we "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "mix",
            "ref": "v-mix"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " these two things together, some air "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "bubbles",
            "ref": "v-bubble"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are created in the dough."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Then, we should "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "add",
            "ref": "v-add"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a little "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "yeast",
            "zh": "酵母"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to the dough. The yeast will grow very quickly when it is warm and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "damp",
            "ref": "v-damp"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "As",
            "zh": "随着"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " it grows, it "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "gives off",
            "zh": "释放"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "gas",
            "ref": "v-gas"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". And that makes the bubbles inside the dough grow bigger."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Finally, we bake the bread. After baking, the bread will have a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "rigid",
            "zh": "不易变形的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " shape with “air pockets” in it!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You see? The holes in the bread are made by bubbles of gas!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n1",
        "type": "note",
        "title": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Did you know?"
          }
        ],
        "content": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The yeast gives the bread a good smell and "
            },
            {
              "t": "gloss",
              "v": "flavour",
              "zh": "风味"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The holes inside the bread make it softer and larger."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
